{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Who says of Cyrus, [C]He is my [Dm]shepherd
He will accomplish [C]all that I [Dm]please
[Bb]Who says of Je[C]rusalem, [F]It shall [C/E]be re[Dm]built
And of the [Bb]temple, Its foun[C]dation shall be [Dm]laid
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
This is what the LORD says [C]to his a[Dm]nointed
