{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 5}
In the [Bb]first year of [Am]Cyrus king of [Dm]Persia
The LORD stirred [C]up the [Bb]spirit of [Dm]Cyrus
He sent a procla[C]mation [Bb]throughout [Dm]his kingdom
